<title>USA: USDA data mildly bearish for bellies - CME traders.</title>
<headline>USDA data mildly bearish for bellies - CME traders.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>CME traders said Friday's U.S. Department of Agriculture cold storage report was mildly bearish for pork belly futures.</p>
<p>They expected the market to open 0.50 to 1.00 cent a lb lower on Monday, with sentiment that Friday's gains were overdone also contributing to anticipated weakness.</p>
</text>
